    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Detachments" hidden="false" id="5218-339c-eb34-9ac0">
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="32fa-1953-1aa2-814e" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true"/>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="true" id="3ef3-dd34-f950-8cdd" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true"/>
      </constraints>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Detachment" hidden="false" id="3fba-26f0-8c24-6ab4" defaultSelectionEntryId="none">
          <constraints>
            <constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="4dd1-ec7c-d8f7-a86d"/>
            <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="6886-c34e-583a-55f8"/>
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Aquilan Shield" hidden="false" id="86f7-83de-81e3-685e">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Gilded Guardians" id="3c0a-06fb-65fa-8b95" hidden="false">
                  <comment>def-mod: source=&quot;Gilded Guardians&quot; wound=-1 when=ranged vsStronger conditional</comment>
                  <description>While a friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** unit (excluding **^^Monster^^**/**^^Vehicle^^** units) is within range of an **objective**, ranged attacks that target that unit with a **S** greater than that unit&apos;s **T** have -1 to **wound rolls**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Favoured Ka&apos;tah: Salvus" id="ddcb-1862-fdc9-3654" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a friendly **readied** unit uses the **Salvus** Ka&apos;tah ability (see Martial Ka&apos;tah), it also gains the following additional effect:

**Additional Effect:** Your unit&apos;s ranged attacks have +6&quot; **R**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="MANOEUVRE AND FIRE (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="e1c0-ab08-4f81-ea52" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=movement</comment>
                  <description>Aquilan Shield – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Movement phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit is selected to make a fall-back move.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: That move does not prevent your unit from being eligible to shoot/declare a charge.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="TIP OF THE TALON (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="8a4a-2c87-994b-d6e3" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=shooting
sim-mod: source=&quot;Tip of the Talon&quot; str=+1 when=ranged conditional</comment>
                  <description>Aquilan Shield – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Shooting phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit is selected to shoot.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: Your unit&apos;s ranged attacks that target an enemy unit within 9&quot; of your unit have +1 S.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="RAPID REACTIONS (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="42d0-313b-3bae-c24c" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=opponent phase=movement</comment>
                  <description>Aquilan Shield – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your opponent&apos;s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a fall-back move.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES INFANTRY unit that was engaged with that enemy unit at the start of the phase.
EFFECT: Your unit shoots using normal shooting, but while doing so your unit can only target that enemy unit.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink id="651c-c386-2aef-6951" name="UNIQUE SHIELD HOST" hidden="false" targetId="07f1-1c3c-4c73-00d2" primary="false"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="1"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="3e8e-f06e-3866-4d84">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Take and Hold</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Dread Host" hidden="false" id="9f8f-8fb6-a7f7-7364">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Instruments of the Emperor&apos;s Wrath" id="5bd9-da0f-a4b5-34ec" hidden="false">
                  <description>Friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** units can re-roll **charge rolls**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Favoured Ka&apos;tah: Dacatarai" id="815d-af4f-cc7d-5fdb" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a friendly **readied** unit uses the **Dacatarai** Ka&apos;tah ability (see Martial Ka&apos;tah), it also gains the following additional effect:

**Additional Effect:** When an enemy unit **engaged** with your unit makes a **pile-in/consolidation move**, -2&quot; from that **pile-in/consolidation move**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="LIGHTNING WRATH (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="dd83-a61e-7cd9-186f" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=fight</comment>
                  <description>Dread Host – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Fight phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit is selected to make a pile-in move.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: When making that pile-in move, your unit can move up to D3+3&quot;.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="GOLDEN LIGHT OF THE MOIRAIDES (Stratagem, 2CP)" id="c39e-7e20-066a-4d6f" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=movement</comment>
                  <description>Dread Host – STRATAGEM (2CP)

WHEN: Your Movement phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit is selected to make an ingress move.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: Until the start of your next turn:
■ Attacks that target your unit have -1 to hit rolls.
■ Enemy units cannot target your unit with snap shooting attacks.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="PRETERNATURAL RAPIDITY (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="2045-da5f-fa85-5996" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=movement</comment>
                  <description>Dread Host – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Movement phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit ends an advance move.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: That advance move does not prevent your unit from being eligible to declare a charge.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink id="34a0-9b94-adc7-3ab7" name="UNIQUE SHIELD HOST" hidden="false" targetId="07f1-1c3c-4c73-00d2" primary="false"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="1"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="31ef-d788-e74b-ac17">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Purge the Foe</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Guardians of the Throne" hidden="false" id="e8e5-b037-1799-8e24">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Martial Mastery" id="068a-b881-1286-43a1" hidden="false">
                  <comment>sim-mod: source=&quot;Martial Mastery (Sustained)&quot; sustained=1 when=melee choice=&quot;Martial Mastery&quot;
sim-mod: source=&quot;Martial Mastery (Lethal)&quot; lethal when=melee choice=&quot;Martial Mastery&quot;</comment>
                  <description>In the Fight phase, when a friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** unit is **selected to fight**, that unit&apos;s melee attacks have:
■ **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]**.
■ Or: **[LETHAL HITS]**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="SUPERHUMAN FOCUS (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="eac2-1240-dd35-e26e" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=any</comment>
                  <description>Guardians of the Throne – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: End of any phase.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit that is not readied.
EFFECT: Your unit is readied.
RESTRICTIONS: You cannot select the same unit as the target of this Stratagem more than once per battle round.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="UNLIMITED ENDURANCE (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="aee4-afe8-2fc0-7bbe" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=movement</comment>
                  <description>Guardians of the Throne – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Movement phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit ends an advance move.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: Until the end of the turn:
■ Your unit&apos;s ranged attacks have [ASSAULT].
■ That advance move does not prevent your unit from being eligible to declare a charge.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="SHIELD OF HONOUR (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="db8f-9f42-807b-0fe1" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=fight</comment>
                  <description>Guardians of the Throne – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Start of the Fight phase.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES INFANTRY/MOUNTED unit.
EFFECT: When an enemy model engaged with your unit selects targets, if that enemy model does not select your unit as the target of all of its attacks, that enemy model&apos;s attacks have:
■ -1 to hit rolls.
■ -1 to wound rolls.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="PRIME TARGET (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="38c3-17ff-4cc7-e5d9" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=shooting</comment>
                  <description>Guardians of the Throne – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Shooting phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit is selected to shoot.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: Your unit&apos;s ranged attacks can:
■ Re-roll one hit roll.
■ Re-roll one wound roll.
■ Re-roll one damage roll.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="IN AURAMITE CLAD (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="3ed2-a643-0290-8b54" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=shooting|fight</comment>
                  <description>Guardians of the Throne – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your opponent&apos;s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit (excluding CUSTODIAN WARDENS units).
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: Attacks that target your unit have -1 AP until that enemy unit has attacked.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="SWIFT AS THE EAGLE (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="d565-1cc2-d4a6-ee90" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=opponent phase=movement</comment>
                  <description>Guardians of the Throne – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your opponent&apos;s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8&quot; of a friendly unengaged TRUSTED SENTINEL unit.
TARGET: That TRUSTED SENTINEL unit.
EFFECT: Your unit can make a normal move of up to D3+3&quot;.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <costs>
                <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="3"/>
              </costs>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" value="2" field="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="d62d-db22-4893-4bc0" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="c654-4899-e88f-6833">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Purge the Foe</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Emperor&apos;s Chosen" hidden="false" id="64f2-9e0e-b8af-bfc1">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Magna Imperator" id="e2e4-7b9a-dce8-cac5" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** unit is selected to attack, that unit&apos;s attacks can:
■ Re-roll one **hit roll**.
■ Re-roll one **wound roll**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Favoured Ka&apos;tah: Rendax" id="2d7d-08b7-1220-fac6" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a friendly **readied** unit uses the **Rendax** Ka&apos;tah ability (see Martial Ka&apos;tah), it also gains the following additional effect:

**Additional Effect:** You can select one enemy **^^Monster^^**/**^^Vehicle^^** unit **engaged** with your unit and roll one D6:
■ On a 1-2, that enemy unit suffers 1 **mortal wound**.
■ On a 3-5, that enemy unit suffers D3 **mortal wounds**.
■ On a 6, that enemy unit suffers 3 **mortal wounds**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="SUPERHUMAN FOCUS (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="3fcf-28fc-0bac-3457" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=any</comment>
                  <description>Emperor&apos;s Chosen – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: End of any phase.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit that is not readied.
EFFECT: Your unit is readied.
RESTRICTIONS: You cannot select the same unit as the target of this Stratagem more than once per battle round.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="IN AURAMITE CLAD (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="66cf-f7e2-7e37-3a23" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=shooting|fight</comment>
                  <description>Emperor&apos;s Chosen – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your opponent&apos;s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit (excluding CUSTODIAN WARDENS units).
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: Attacks that target your unit have -1 AP until that enemy unit has attacked.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="IMPENETRABLE BASTION (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="c204-81f1-ded8-5121" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=movement</comment>
                  <description>Emperor&apos;s Chosen – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: End of your Movement phase.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit (excluding MONSTER/VEHICLE units).
EFFECT: Select one objective your unit is controlling. That objective is secured.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink id="511f-3689-c93a-667f" name="UNIQUE SHIELD HOST" hidden="false" targetId="07f1-1c3c-4c73-00d2" primary="false"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="1"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="178f-8fb1-756e-004e">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Take and Hold</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Emissaries Imperatus" hidden="false" id="2731-4385-9feb-3cfb">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Heralds of the Throne" id="5059-d219-b1a5-29e2" hidden="false">
                  <description>Friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** units have **Fights First**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Favoured Ka&apos;tah: Conservai" id="e244-8309-c647-1b1b" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a friendly **readied** unit uses the **Conservai** Ka&apos;tah ability (see Martial Ka&apos;tah), it also gains the following additional effect:

**Additional Effect:** Until the end of the turn, being selected to make an **advance/fall-back move** does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to start an action**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="BEARERS OF HIS LIGHT (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="d325-895f-dcc3-ca6e" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=fight</comment>
                  <description>Emissaries Imperatus – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Fight phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit is selected to fight.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: Your unit&apos;s melee attacks can ignore modifiers to hit rolls and wound rolls.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="SLAYERS OF NIGHTMARES (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="100f-d314-0885-d642" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=fight
sim-mod: source=&quot;Slayers of Nightmares&quot; wound=+1 when=melee vsTougher</comment>
                  <description>Emissaries Imperatus – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Fight phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit is selected to fight.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: Your unit&apos;s melee attacks that target a unit with a T greater than this unit&apos;s T have +1 to wound rolls.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="SELFLESS SERVICE (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="7d7b-b8dd-466a-04ce" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=opponent phase=charge</comment>
                  <description>Emissaries Imperatus – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: End of your opponent&apos;s Charge phase.
TARGET: One friendly unengaged ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit within 6&quot; of an enemy unit. You can only select a VEHICLE unit if it is a CHARACTER/WALKER unit.
EFFECT: Declare a charge with your unit:
■ When making the charge roll, if the result is greater than 6 (after modifiers), change it to 6.
■ When selecting charge targets, you can select any enemy units that are within 6&quot; of your unit and within the maximum distance.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink id="3d8b-c581-f351-a856" name="UNIQUE SHIELD HOST" hidden="false" targetId="07f1-1c3c-4c73-00d2" primary="false"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="1"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="b8d7-7864-97b1-31dd">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Priority Assets</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Shadowkeepers" hidden="false" id="a523-f371-929a-4c97">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Wardens of the Dark Cells" id="2b7d-d022-c262-0504" hidden="false">
                  <comment>def-mod: source=&quot;Wardens of the Dark Cells&quot; wound=-1 when=melee vsStronger conditional</comment>
                  <description>While a friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** unit (excluding **^^Monster^^**/**^^Vehicle^^** units) is within range of an **objective**, melee attacks that target that unit with a **S** greater than that unit&apos;s **T** have -1 to **wound rolls**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Favoured Ka&apos;tah: Kaptaris" id="560f-c675-0953-0e25" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a friendly **readied** unit uses the **Kaptaris** Ka&apos;tah ability (see Martial Ka&apos;tah), it also gains the following additional effect:

**Additional Effect:** You can select one enemy unit **engaged** with your unit. That enemy unit must make a **battle-shock roll**, with -1 to that **battle-shock roll**. You cannot select the same enemy unit for this effect more than once per phase.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="GRIM RESPONSIBILITY (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="bdef-86ce-3a0a-d667" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=fight
sim-mod: source=&quot;Grim Responsibility&quot; lethal when=melee vs=Character,Monster</comment>
                  <description>Shadowkeepers – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Fight phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES INFANTRY unit is selected to fight.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: Your unit&apos;s melee attacks have [LETHAL HITS: CHARACTER/MONSTER].</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="NO ESCAPE (Stratagem, 2CP)" id="d776-bea3-f5e8-cc0d" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=opponent phase=movement</comment>
                  <description>Shadowkeepers – STRATAGEM (2CP)

WHEN: Your opponent&apos;s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a fall-back move.
TARGET: One friendly unengaged ADEPTUS CUSTODES INFANTRY unit that is within 6&quot; of that enemy unit.
EFFECT: Declare a charge with your unit. When selecting charge targets, you can only select enemy units that made a fall-back move this phase and are within the maximum distance.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="INDOMITABLE GUARDIANS (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="c943-b0c6-2f23-6ac2" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=opponent phase=fight</comment>
                  <description>Shadowkeepers – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your opponent&apos;s Fight phase, when an enemy unit has fought.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit that is within range of an objective and is eligible to fight.
EFFECT: Your unit has Fights First and must be the next unit you select to fight.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink id="197e-b7d0-e7bb-099e" name="UNIQUE SHIELD HOST" hidden="false" targetId="07f1-1c3c-4c73-00d2" primary="false"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="1"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="5519-b35c-3f0e-007e">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Take and Hold</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Solar Watch" hidden="false" id="7beb-6458-8c16-9234">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Talon Sortie" id="5884-6e4f-c310-80ee" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** unit makes a **fall-back move**, that **fall-back move** does not prevent that unit from being **eligible to charge**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Favoured Ka&apos;tah: Calistus" id="b133-4b6b-2709-2457" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a friendly **readied** unit uses the **Calistus** Ka&apos;tah ability (see Martial Ka&apos;tah), it also gains the following additional effect:

**Additional Effect:** Your unit has +2&quot; **M**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="INEXORABLE (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="e374-32d4-3449-af05" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=movement</comment>
                  <description>Solar Watch – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Movement phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit is selected to move.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: Until the end of the turn, your unit can ignore modifiers to your unit&apos;s:
■ M.
■ Advance rolls and charge rolls.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="AT SPEAR&apos;S LENGTH (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="4361-4fb7-eba5-7628" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=movement</comment>
                  <description>Solar Watch – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Movement phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit is selected to make a fall-back move.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: That fall-back move does not prevent your unit from being eligible to shoot.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="GRAVIMETRIC GRENADE (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="2c28-c318-2443-788a" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=opponent phase=charge</comment>
                  <description>Solar Watch – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Start of your opponent&apos;s Charge phase.
TARGET: One friendly unengaged ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: Select one visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of your unit. When that enemy unit declares a charge, that enemy unit has -1 to charge rolls.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink id="82bf-6151-0758-8e13" name="UNIQUE SHIELD HOST" hidden="false" targetId="07f1-1c3c-4c73-00d2" primary="false"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="1"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="4164-3339-bed0-5e43">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Reconnaissance</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Auric Champions" hidden="false" id="6a8c-0707-43be-6c5f">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Assemblage of Might" id="1ede-31dc-c25a-b6c2" hidden="false">
                  <comment>sim-mod: source=&quot;Assemblage of Might&quot; wound=+1 conditional kw=&quot;Character&quot;</comment>
                  <description>In your Command phase, you can select one enemy unit to be a **dreadful foe** unit until the start of your next Command phase. Friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** **^^Character^^** models&apos; attacks that target a **dreadful foe** unit have +1 to **wound rolls**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="GILDED CHAMPION (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="be40-d747-e299-9191" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=any</comment>
                  <description>Auric Champions – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Any phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES CHARACTER model has used a (Once per battle, per unit) datasheet ability.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES CHARACTER model.
EFFECT: Your model can use that (Once per battle, per unit) datasheet ability one additional time, but not in the same phase.
RESTRICTIONS: You cannot use this stratagem on the same ADEPTUS CUSTODES CHARACTER model more than once per battle.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="DUTY UNTO DEATH (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="71d6-6a33-1b70-98cb" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=fight</comment>
                  <description>Auric Champions – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit.
EFFECT: When a model in your unit is destroyed, if your unit has not been selected to fight this phase, roll one D6, with +1 to that roll if that model is a CHARACTER model:
■ On a 3+, do not remove that model from the battlefield. When your unit has fought, or at the end of the phase (whichever comes first), that model is removed from the battlefield.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <costs>
                <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="1"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="3552-560d-9ea7-9d97">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Priority Assets</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Honoured Companions" hidden="false" id="f07b-4220-d6cb-3c4d">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Companion&apos;s Watch" id="0f9f-39eb-70fe-3b63" hidden="false">
                  <comment>sim-mod: source=&quot;Companion&apos;s Watch&quot; reroll=wound1 conditional kw=&quot;Trusted Sentinel&quot;</comment>
                  <description>While a friendly **^^Trusted Sentinel^^** unit is within range of an **objective**, that unit&apos;s attacks can re-roll **wound rolls** of 1.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="EMPEROR&apos;S DOMAIN (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="0410-6842-a04d-34eb" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=fight</comment>
                  <description>Honoured Companions – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Fight phase, when a friendly TRUSTED SENTINEL unit is selected to make a consolidation move.
TARGET: That TRUSTED SENTINEL unit.
EFFECT: You can select the objective consolidation mode for that consolidation move, regardless of that consolidation move&apos;s Before Moving restrictions. This means your unit can move out of engagement range with enemy units, provided it meets the conditions of the objective consolidation mode.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="AVENGE THE FALLEN (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="1887-470c-bb27-0fc2" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=fight
sim-mod: source=&quot;Avenge the Fallen&quot; attacks=+2 when=melee conditional kw=&quot;Trusted Sentinel&quot;</comment>
                  <description>Honoured Companions – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Fight phase, when a friendly TRUSTED SENTINEL unit that is below starting strength is selected to fight.
TARGET: That TRUSTED SENTINEL unit.
EFFECT: Your unit&apos;s melee attacks (excluding those made by CHARACTER models) have +2 A.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="SWIFT AS THE EAGLE (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="226f-0b8e-1aec-7105" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=opponent phase=movement</comment>
                  <description>Honoured Companions – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your opponent&apos;s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8&quot; of a friendly unengaged TRUSTED SENTINEL unit.
TARGET: That TRUSTED SENTINEL unit.
EFFECT: Your unit can make a normal move of up to D3+3&quot;.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <costs>
                <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="1"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="b79a-6fc9-863a-a1ff">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Take and Hold</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Lions of the Emperor" hidden="false" id="1ce9-1fad-0022-b21d">
              <rules>
                <rule name="On Gilded Wings" id="8aeb-2370-d4aa-ce88" hidden="false">
                  <description>At the end of your opponent&apos;s Fight phase, if a friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** **^^Terminator^^** unit is **unengaged**, you can place that unit in **strategic reserves**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="VIGIL UNENDING (Stratagem, 2CP)" id="12ec-13ec-6ac8-f88b" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=shooting|fight</comment>
                  <description>Lions of the Emperor – STRATAGEM (2CP)

WHEN: Your opponent&apos;s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES TERMINATOR unit.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES TERMINATOR unit.
EFFECT: Attacks that target your unit have -1 D until that enemy unit has attacked.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="UNLEASH THE LIONS (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="4ba0-16cb-8090-603f" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=command</comment>
                  <description>Lions of the Emperor – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Command phase.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES TERMINATOR unit that has 2+ models.
EFFECT: Your unit is split into separate units, each containing one model. These new units each have a starting strength of 1.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="FURY OF THE EMPEROR (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="97b6-ece8-5b45-b1cd" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=charge</comment>
                  <description>Lions of the Emperor – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Charge phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES TERMINATOR unit that made an ingress move this turn is selected to declare a charge.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES TERMINATOR unit.
EFFECT: Your unit has +2 to charge rolls.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <costs>
                <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="1"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="6ce5-4d0b-3b2d-d0e4">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Take and Hold</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Grav-Assault Force" hidden="false" id="72be-3a84-8503-ec31">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Flare Shields" id="b670-e04c-22ca-9fe1" hidden="false">
                  <description>Friendly **^^Grav-Assault^^** units have 4+ **InSv** against ranged attacks.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="VICTORY BEFORE DEATH (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="ab9e-61f6-815d-f5b0" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=any</comment>
                  <description>Grav-Assault Force – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Any phase, when a friendly GRAV-ASSAULT unit within range of an objective is destroyed.
TARGET: That GRAV-ASSAULT unit. You can target that unit with this stratagem even though it is destroyed.
EFFECT: Select one objective that:
■ Your unit was controlling when it was destroyed.
■ Has no enemy units (excluding AIRCRAFT units) within range of it.
That objective is secured.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="ADVANCED STABILISERS (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="7bcf-a295-0055-b980" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=shooting</comment>
                  <description>Grav-Assault Force – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Shooting phase, when a friendly GRAV-ASSAULT unit is selected to shoot.
TARGET: That GRAV-ASSAULT unit.
EFFECT: Your unit&apos;s ranged attacks have [ASSAULT].</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="INEVITABLE ANNIHILATION (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="16fe-c5be-29ae-d52f" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=shooting</comment>
                  <description>Grav-Assault Force – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Shooting phase, when a friendly GRAV-ASSAULT unit is selected to shoot.
TARGET: That GRAV-ASSAULT unit.
EFFECT: Your unit can ignore modifiers to your unit&apos;s:
■ BS.
■ Hit rolls.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <costs>
                <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="1"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="a688-6695-4011-19d0">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Purge the Foe</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Null Maiden Vigil" hidden="false" id="688a-447d-fb93-b63d">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Silent Sisterhood" id="7e7f-0d29-64a0-8d70" hidden="false">
                  <description>■ When mustering your army, you can select a friendly **^^Anathema Psykana^^** **^^Character^^** model to be your **^^Warlord^^**.
■ Friendly **^^Prosecutor Squad^^** units have **^^Battleline^^**.
■ Friendly **^^Anathema Psykana^^** units have the following ability:

**Creeping Dread (Aura):** In the Battle-shock step of your opponent&apos;s Command phase, each enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit that is a **^^Psyker^^** unit/below **starting strength** makes a **battle-shock roll**, with -1 to that **battle-shock roll**.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="ANATHEMA BLADEMASTERY (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="d692-5b40-d538-4809" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=fight
sim-mod: source=&quot;Anathema Blademastery (Sustained)&quot; sustained=1 kw=&quot;Vigilator Squad&quot; choice=&quot;Anathema Blademastery&quot;
sim-mod: source=&quot;Anathema Blademastery (Lethal)&quot; lethal kw=&quot;Vigilator Squad&quot; choice=&quot;Anathema Blademastery&quot;</comment>
                  <description>Null Maiden Vigil – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Fight phase, when a friendly VIGILATOR SQUAD unit is selected to fight.
TARGET: That VIGILATOR SQUAD unit.
EFFECT: Your unit&apos;s attacks have:
■ [SUSTAINED HITS 1]
■ Or: [LETHAL HITS].</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="PSY-CHAFF VOLLEY (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="009e-9f36-2ada-3058" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=shooting</comment>
                  <description>Null Maiden Vigil – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Shooting phase, when a friendly PROSECUTOR SQUAD unit has shot.
TARGET: That PROSECUTOR SQUAD unit.
EFFECT: Select one enemy unit hit by those attacks. That unit is prosecuted until the end of the turn:
■ Attacks that target a prosecuted unit have +1 AP.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="PURGATION SWEEP (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="974c-e0a9-5119-d987" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=shooting
sim-mod: source=&quot;Purgation Sweep&quot; attacks=+1 when=ranged kw=&quot;Witchseeker Squad&quot;</comment>
                  <description>Null Maiden Vigil – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Shooting phase, when a friendly WITCHSEEKER SQUAD unit is selected to shoot.
TARGET: That WITCHSEEKER SQUAD unit.
EFFECT: Your unit&apos;s [TORRENT] attacks have:
■ +1 A.
■ Or: If those attacks target a PSYKER/battle-shocked unit, +2 A.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <costs>
                <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="1"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="e62f-90b7-86d6-5733">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Reconnaissance</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Might of the Moritoi" hidden="false" id="c99d-3cde-d6f7-ae15">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Moritoi Ancients" id="9c98-a3d5-6f81-dec1" hidden="false">
                  <comment>sim-mod: source=&quot;Moritoi Ancients&quot; reroll=hit1 conditional kw=&quot;Dreadnought&quot;
sim-mod: source=&quot;Moritoi Ancients (below half-strength)&quot; reroll=wound1 conditional kw=&quot;Dreadnought&quot;</comment>
                  <description>■ While a friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** **^^Dreadnought^^** unit is at **starting strength**, that unit has +2 **OC**.
■ While a friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** **^^Dreadnought^^** unit is below **starting strength**, that unit&apos;s attacks can re-roll **hit rolls** of 1.
■ While a friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** **^^Dreadnought^^** unit is **below half-strength**, that unit&apos;s attacks can:
  ■ Re-roll **hit rolls** of 1.
  ■ Re-roll **wound rolls** of 1.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="HONOURED INTERRED (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="0b52-4d36-2a94-fadd" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=shooting|fight</comment>
                  <description>Might of the Moritoi – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT unit.
EFFECT: Your unit has the following ability:
HONOURED INTERRED (AURA): Friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES units within 6&quot; of this unit can re-roll hit rolls of 1.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="UNCEASING ONSLAUGHT (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="c921-53c5-753f-9067" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=movement</comment>
                  <description>Might of the Moritoi – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Movement phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT unit ends an advance move.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT unit.
EFFECT: ■ Your unit&apos;s ranged attacks have [ASSAULT] until the end of the turn.
■ That move does not prevent your unit from being eligible to declare a charge.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="UNSTOPPABLE MOMENTUM (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="7cc9-f39f-401d-9fb6" hidden="false">
                  <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=movement|charge</comment>
                  <description>Might of the Moritoi – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Movement/Charge phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT unit is selected to move or declares a charge.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS CUSTODES DREADNOUGHT unit.
EFFECT: Your unit has MOBILE.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <costs>
                <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="1"/>
              </costs>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="7649-ab4f-a3db-cde7">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Take and Hold</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
