            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Adeptus Custodes^^** **^^Infantry^^**/**^^Mounted^^** unit only (excluding **^^Terminator^^** units). This unit has +1 to **advance rolls** and **charge rolls**.</characteristic>
