                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Adeptus Custodes^^** **^^Infantry^^** model only. **(Once per battle round, per army)** At the start of any phase, you can select one friendly **battle-shocked** **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** unit within 9&quot; of this model. That unit is no longer **battle-shocked**.</characteristic>
