                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Adeptus Custodes^^** **^^Infantry^^** model only. At the end of a phase in which this model is **destroyed**, roll one D6:
■ On a 2+, set this model back up on the battlefield as close as possible to where it was **destroyed**, **unengaged**, with 3 wounds remaining.</characteristic>
