              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Complete two battles in which you destroy the three units from your opponent&apos;s army with the highest points values (if one or more units are tied in this way, then the destruction of any of them counts towards this Imperative).</characteristic>
