  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="e348-7090-3aff-ee2c" name="Martial Ka&apos;tah" hidden="false">
      <comment>sim-mod: source=&quot;Martial Ka&apos;tah (Dacatarai)&quot; reroll=hit1 when=melee conditional choice=&quot;Martial Ka&apos;tah&quot;
sim-mod: source=&quot;Martial Ka&apos;tah (Rendax)&quot; lethal when=melee vs=Monster,Vehicle choice=&quot;Martial Ka&apos;tah&quot;</comment>
      <description>At the start of your Command phase, each friendly unit with this ability becomes **readied**. During the turn, when the conditions of one of the Ka&apos;tah abilities below are met, you can select one **readied** unit and use that Ka&apos;tah ability on it.

■ **CONSERVAI**
WHEN: Your Command phase.
TARGET: One friendly **readied** unit.
EFFECT: Until the end of the turn:
- Being **engaged/battle-shocked** does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to start an action**.
- Starting an **action** does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to shoot**.

■ **CALISTUS**
WHEN: Your Movement phase, when a friendly **readied** unit is **selected to move**.
TARGET: That **readied** unit.
EFFECT: When your unit makes a **normal/advance/fall-back move**, your unit can move through all types of model.

■ **SALVUS**
WHEN: Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **readied** unit is **selected to shoot**.
TARGET: That **readied** unit.
EFFECT: Your unit can ignore modifiers to your unit&apos;s:
- **BS**.
- **Hit rolls** and **wound rolls**.

■ **DACATARAI**
WHEN: Start of the Fight phase.
TARGET: One friendly **readied** unit.
EFFECT: Your unit&apos;s melee attacks that target an enemy unit (excluding **^^Monster^^**/**^^Vehicle^^** units) can **re-roll hit rolls** of 1.

■ **KAPTARIS**
WHEN: Start of the Fight phase.
TARGET: One friendly **readied** unit.
EFFECT: Melee attacks that target your unit have -1 to **hit rolls**.

■ **RENDAX**
WHEN: Fight phase, when a friendly **readied** unit is **selected to fight**.
TARGET: One friendly **readied** unit.
EFFECT: Your unit&apos;s melee attacks have **[LETHAL HITS: ^^Monster^^/^^Vehicle^^]**.</description>
      <modifiers>
        <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
          <conditions>
            <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="model-or-unit" childId="d55b-94a6-3265-fa09" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true"/>
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
    </rule>
    <rule id="7a3a-262b-bd7b-6e8c" name="Aegis of the Emperor" hidden="false">
      <description>Friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** units with this ability have **Feel No Pain 5+** against **mortal wounds**.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="e8af-7949-4b1b-470d" name="Daughters of the Abyss" hidden="false">
      <comment>def-mod: source=&quot;Daughters of the Abyss&quot; fnp=3 conditional manual</comment>
      <description>■ Friendly **^^Anathema Psykana^^** units with this ability have **Feel No Pain 3+** against **psychic attacks**.
■ Friendly **^^Anathema Psykana^^** units with this ability have the following ability:

**Psychic Null (Aura):** Friendly **^^Adeptus Custodes^^** units within 6&quot; of this unit have **Feel No Pain 5+** against **psychic attacks**.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="5b8b-3c72-b14b-e95b" name="Aquila Commander" hidden="false">
      <description>At the start of the battle round, if a model with this ability is your **^^Warlord^^**, gain 1CP.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
  <sharedProfiles>
